        <div class="dv" style={`--from:${hexOf.k};--to:${hexOf.m}`} aria-hidden="true"><Bits rows={dissolve(11, 27, 2)} /></div>

        <section class="f m sec bio" id="about">
          <div class="w">
            <div>
              <p class="lab mono">Who's holding the camera</p>
              <p class="say">I'm Oscar. I shoot the events tech people actually go to — <em>hackathons</em> at hour 22, <em>demo nights</em> where the wifi holds, <em>launch parties</em>, panels, and founders in wetsuits.</p>
              <p class="small">I build things too, so I know which moments matter: the demo that lands, the room reacting, the hallway chat that turns into a company. I work quietly, I don't need a brief the length of a PRD, and you get pictures people actually want to post.</p>
            </div>
